# `tlon surface preview` writes its capture matrix here (bind-mounted
# into the 6a container). Screenshots are evidence, not source.
*
!.gitignore

# Two exceptions, and they are exceptions for a reason.
#
# The clean seed's run log is the RECORD of which group and which channels a
# measurement ran against. 6a.5's generations landed on boards an earlier run
# had built and nobody could tell afterwards, because nothing had written down
# what was there before. A record that lives only on the machine that produced
# it does not answer that for a reader, so these two small text files are
# tracked while the megabytes of PNGs around them are not.
#
# Everything else here — the twelve-cell capture matrices, the fetched bundles,
# the per-request assertion dumps — stays evidence: large, regenerable, and
# quoted into the session report rather than committed.
!verdict-run/
verdict-run/*
!verdict-run/seed.json
!verdict-run/seed.md
